<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.
<p>I'm sorry to hear that we were unable to provide a bassinet seat for you and your family on-board&nbsp; QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}&nbsp;to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.</p>

<p>While we try to meet every customer's seating preference, even when you have been pre-allocated a seat, sometimes we need to rearrange the seating for operational, safety or security reasons, even after boarding the aircraft.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If paid for bassinet seating, add:</em></strong><br />
<strong>Your refund has been requested</strong><br />
I've contacted our refunds team on your behalf and the additional charge for a Seat with Bassinet will be refunded back to the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If offering goodwill gesture due to tier of Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with us.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and I hope that we can make your journey with us and <strong>&lt;INFANT NAME&gt; </strong>more comfortable next time you fly with Qantas.</p>
</body>
</html>